        "type": "conversation_part"
      },
      {
        "author": {
          "id": "customer",
          "name": "Elwenna Elmtree",
          "type": "user"
        },
        "body": "Sure — every time we issue payments to third-party suppliers, we can’t validate their bank details ahead of time, which means payments bounce and we’re stuck reissuing days later.",
        "created_at": 1791969258,
        "id": "4f0c3f4613e9-3",
        "part_type": "comment",
        "type": "conversation_part"
      },
      {
        "author": {
          "id": "customer",
          "name": "Elwenna Elmtree",
          "type": "user"
        },
        "body": "We’re struggling because we can’t verify third-party payee bank details before sending payments — it forces us to reissue failed payments days later, which delays claims resolution for policyholders. Payee account verification would really help.",
        "created_at": 1791969270,
        "id": "4f0c3f4613e9-4",
        "part_type": "comment",
        "type": "conversation_part"
      },
      {
