        },
        "body": "Internal note: Elwenna Elmtree from Thistlecombe Mutual raised payee account verification as blocker for claims payments. Escalated per SLA.",
        "created_at": 1791969284,
        "id": "4f0c3f4613e9-5",
        "part_type": "note",
        "type": "conversation_part"
      },
      {
        "author": {
          "id": "internal",
          "name": "Bryn Telford",
          "type": "admin"
        },
        "body": "That’s frustrating. I’ll flag this as a feature request — we don’t currently support pre-payment payee account verification, but I’ll escalate it to the product team.",
        "created_at": 1791969292,
        "id": "4f0c3f4613e9-6",
